  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Possible values for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;containing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math>&nbsp;integers.</p><p>But given range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;would take values&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, containing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;integers.</p><p>And,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn></math>&nbsp;numbers.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Required probability</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
